<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37789" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορτάζω</span></b> , in 
			Ion.
		Prose <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρτάζω:</span></b> 
		impf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑώρταζον</span> (with irreg. augm.) <i><span class="en">
			Isoc.
			19.40
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Paus.
			4.19.4
		</span></i>: fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.18
			</span></i>, etc.: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑώρτασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					48.34
				</span></i>
			, etc.; inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορτάσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1079
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				458a
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεορτάζω</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορτή</span>):—<i>keep festival</i>
			or <i>holiday,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				122
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1458
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορτὰς ἑ.</span>
			<i>celebrate</i> festivals, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρας τέτταρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cam.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γενέθλιόν τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					493.26
				</span></i>
			 (Ephesus, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. τῷ θεῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Anach.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>celebrate as a festival,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκην ἑ.</span>
			<i>celebrate</i> it <i>by a festival,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.349f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				56
			</span></i>; at Rome, <i>celebrate by a triumph,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				51.21
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
